WEBVTT

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:36.910 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:37.010 --> 00:01:39.960 line:0%
[Episode 22]

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.589 line:0%
[Full of Nature Bestows]

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:56.400 line:0%
Xing has gotten married.

00:01:57.140 --> 00:01:58.300 line:0%
And Caiwei

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:01.360 line:0%
is about to get married too.

00:02:01.450 --> 00:02:02.500 line:0%
Yijiao.

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:03.840 line:0%
You insist on not going back

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:05.770 line:0%
with your husband.

00:02:05.840 --> 00:02:08.640 line:0%
What future do you have staying in the Yan family?

00:02:08.839 --> 00:02:10.770 line:0%
My husband came to ask me to go back,

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:13.050 line:0%
but it only means returning to the life

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:14.680 line:0%
which seems glamorous on the surface

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:16.140 line:0%
but is actually desolate.

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:18.720 line:0%
It would only be for the sake of both families' reputation.

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:20.720 line:0%
How is it any different from before?

00:02:20.879 --> 00:02:22.600 line:0%
Why can't I be like Xing,

00:02:22.760 --> 00:02:24.200 line:0%
dedicated to studying,

00:02:24.280 --> 00:02:25.940 line:0%
pursuing an official career,

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:28.090 line:0%
or even just becoming an embroiderer?

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:29.400 line:0%
No matter which path, I'd be making a living

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:30.920 line:0%
with my own hands.

00:02:31.280 --> 00:02:32.879 line:0%
But a woman who gets divorced

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:35.290 line:0%
will inevitably face people's judgment.

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:36.960 line:0%
The entire Yan family

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:39.000 line:0%
will lose face.

00:02:39.020 --> 00:02:40.660 line:0%
Even your sisters

00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:41.640 line:0%
will be looked down upon

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:43.560 line:0%
by their in-laws because of you.

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:44.980 line:0%
Father.

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:46.040 line:0%
I've

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:47.400 line:0%
heard you talk about how important

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:48.960 line:0%
the Yan family's reputation is since childhood.

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:50.720 line:0%
The reputation of the Yan family is certainly important,

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:51.520 line:0%
but if we were to exchange

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:52.879 line:0%
Yijiao's lifelong happiness for it,

00:02:52.879 --> 00:02:54.600 line:0%
the price would be too high.

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:56.240 line:0%
During this time,

00:02:56.440 --> 00:02:58.200 line:0%
our Yan family has endured many hardships.

00:02:58.200 --> 00:02:59.360 line:0%
None of them

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:01.280 line:0%
was overcome by reputation.

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:06.970 line:0%
Honey.

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:08.280 line:0%
Come on, sit.

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:13.010 line:0%
Father.

00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:14.680 line:0%
Shiyuan certainly won't

00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:15.720 line:0%
look down on me

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:17.290 line:0%
because of Yijiao's divorce.

00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:18.400 line:0%
I'm sure the Grand Commander

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:19.480 line:0%
won't belittle Xing

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:21.040 line:0%
because of this matter either.

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:21.879 line:0%
As long as our entire family

00:03:21.879 --> 00:03:23.440 line:0%
doesn't look down on Yijiao,

00:03:23.440 --> 00:03:25.440 line:0%
who else would belittle her?

00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:29.540 line:0%
Caiwei is right.

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:31.160 line:0%
Honey.

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:33.520 line:0%
Now that we've finally

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:35.560 line:0%
settled as a family in Xiang'an City

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:37.390 line:0%
and started a peaceful life,

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:39.930 line:0%
why should we let our children

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:40.920 line:0%
suffer and be wronged

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:42.720 line:0%
for the sake of some reputation?

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:52.180 line:0%
As the saying goes, a grown daughter is beyond her father's control.

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:53.910 line:0%
I'll leave it up to you to decide

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:57.100 line:0%
what the future holds.

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:04.860 line:0%
Thank you, Father.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:19.190 line:0%
Jin Zang, you're here.

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:20.240 line:0%
Dr. Yan.

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:22.210 line:0%
Please, come in. Come in.

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:23.450 line:0%
A small gift from me.

00:04:24.020 --> 00:04:24.640 line:0%
Dr. Yan.

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:25.160 line:0%
Please, come in.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.520 line:0%
Congratulations. Congratulations.

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:27.720 line:0%
Please, come in.

00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:29.300 line:0%
Come on, have a seat inside.

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:31.080 line:0%
Xing.

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:32.920 line:0%
-Your uncle's here.
-Uncle.

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:34.490 line:0%
Deputy Minister Zhang.

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:37.280 line:0%
Please, come in.

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:41.360 line:0%
Deputy Minister Zhang, please take a seat.

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:42.160 line:0%
That's wrong.

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:51.880 line:0%
Shiyuan.

00:04:55.150 --> 00:04:56.120 line:0%
I'm only here to...

00:04:56.120 --> 00:04:56.959 line:0%
Naturally, you should sit

00:04:56.959 --> 00:04:58.820 line:0%
on the groom's side of the guests.

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:07.160 line:0%
Right, right.

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:08.360 line:0%
Groom's side.

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:09.880 line:0%
Right, right.

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:11.580 line:0%
Of course, I'm with the groom.

00:05:16.990 --> 00:05:19.450 line:0%
Why hasn't the auspicious time arrived yet?

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:27.800 line:0%
Xing.

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:29.200 line:0%
So your father really agreed

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:30.560 line:0%
to Yijiao's divorce?

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:33.240 line:0%
It's rare for him to consider

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:35.420 line:0%
his children's affairs more important than reputation.

00:05:35.420 --> 00:05:36.670 line:0%
That's a good thing.

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:38.700 line:0%
This way,

00:05:38.959 --> 00:05:40.670 line:0%
when it's your turn to get a divorce,

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:42.750 line:0%
your father will be well-practiced.

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:45.240 line:0%
Me?

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:46.000 line:0%
Your three-month agreement with the White Ghost

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:47.720 line:0%
is about to expire.

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:51.120 line:0%
Are you unwilling to

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:52.440 line:0%
make preparations in advance?

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:54.170 line:0%
You don't think the White Ghost

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:57.250 line:0%
will give you a hard time when the time comes, will he?

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:01.830 line:0%
Why hasn't the White Ghost arrived yet?

00:06:05.410 --> 00:06:06.580 line:0%
Lord Lai.

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:08.760 line:0%
Please, come in.

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:10.840 line:0%
Not all the guests have arrived yet,

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:13.170 line:0%
and the banquet is already about to start?

00:06:26.350 --> 00:06:27.800 line:0%
Without you here, Lord Lai,

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:29.400 line:0%
how could it possibly start?

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:48.200 line:0%
What?

00:06:48.360 --> 00:06:50.200 line:0%
I serve in the same court

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:51.920 line:0%
with Grand Commander Shen and Dr. Yan.

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:54.620 line:0%
If Grand Commander Shen can attend this wedding banquet,

00:06:54.620 --> 00:06:55.950 line:0%
why can't I?

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:08.080 line:0%
Moreover,

00:07:08.850 --> 00:07:10.400 line:0%
Yan Caiwei was previously

00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:12.640 line:0%
poisoned by Chen Huo'e's deadly venom.

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:15.640 line:0%
I was the one who provided the antidote,

00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:19.780 line:0%
which essentially saved Yan Caiwei's life.

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:27.880 line:0%
So coming now to drink a cup of celebratory wine

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:31.360 line:0%
is perfectly acceptable, isn't it?

00:07:36.090 --> 00:07:37.550 line:0%
If you're here for a drink,

00:07:39.610 --> 00:07:41.010 line:0%
surely we'll provide it.

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:47.520 line:0%
Commander Shen.

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:49.240 line:0%
Lord Lai.

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:55.400 line:0%
I apologize for not greeting you from afar.

00:07:55.920 --> 00:07:56.720 line:0%
Today

00:07:58.940 --> 00:08:01.130 line:0%
is a joyous day for my younger brother.

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:06.540 line:0%
I'm truly grateful that both of you could come

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:07.970 line:0%
to offer your blessings.

00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:10.320 line:0%
Why don't we all take our seats first?

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:12.330 line:0%
We can catch up after we're seated.

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:13.160 line:0%
Shall we?

00:08:15.520 --> 00:08:16.320 line:0%
Alright.

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:21.800 line:0%
I've already brought the congratulatory gift,

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:23.460 line:0%
so I won't intrude any longer.

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:31.460 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen.

00:08:32.560 --> 00:08:33.420 line:0%
I take my leave.

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:51.180 line:0%
Thank you all for coming today

00:08:51.180 --> 00:08:52.640 line:0%
to my daughter's wedding.

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:55.570 line:0%
You truly honor us with your presence.

00:08:55.600 --> 00:08:56.080 line:0%
Indeed.

00:08:57.120 --> 00:08:58.320 line:0%
Please, everyone, take your seats.

00:08:58.320 --> 00:08:59.720 line:0%
Take your seats, please.

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:01.500 line:0%
Please. Please.

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:02.160 line:0%
Please.

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:25.540 line:0%
It's the auspicious time!

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:18.040 line:0%
Good. Good.

00:10:38.480 --> 00:10:40.030 line:0%
Regarding the civil service transfer order,

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:40.920 line:0%
Minister Zhang

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:43.120 line:0%
didn't cause any trouble for my father.

00:10:43.270 --> 00:10:45.240 line:0%
Did you help out?

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:49.960 line:0%
No.

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:51.340 line:0%
Really?

00:10:55.850 --> 00:10:56.650 line:0%
Thank you.

00:11:12.280 --> 00:11:14.280 line:0%
Urgent report from Gannan Area!

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:19.810 line:0%
Urgent report from Gannan Area!

00:11:27.650 --> 00:11:28.820 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:32.270 line:0%
An urgent report has arrived from Gannan Area.

00:11:32.270 --> 00:11:33.370 line:0%
Gannan Area?

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:35.920 line:0%
Mo Qianzhi, the prefectural governor of Yingzhou,

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.020 line:0%
has submitted a petition,

00:11:37.020 --> 00:11:39.600 line:0%
reporting multiple recent cases in Gannan Area of

00:11:39.600 --> 00:11:41.660 line:0%
a "half-faced ghost" eating people.

00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:44.230 line:0%
What?

00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:45.880 line:0%
It is said that this "half-faced ghost"

00:11:45.880 --> 00:11:47.360 line:0%
attacks when people are unconscious,

00:11:47.360 --> 00:11:48.160 line:0%
and each time,

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:50.400 line:0%
it only eats one part of the victim's body.

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:52.330 line:0%
When the victims wake up, they'd find

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:54.190 line:0%
that their limbs are incomplete.

00:11:55.570 --> 00:11:56.660 line:0%
Absurd.

00:11:58.400 --> 00:11:59.680 line:0%
In broad daylight,

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:02.210 line:0%
how can such a calamity be allowed?

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:03.980 line:0%
At first glance,

00:12:04.120 --> 00:12:05.520 line:0%
it is indeed terrifying.

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:07.440 line:0%
However, upon careful consideration,

00:12:07.440 --> 00:12:09.600 line:0%
I find it somewhat similar to the previous

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:11.480 line:0%
Chen Huo'e case.

00:12:12.720 --> 00:12:14.280 line:0%
Pretending to be supernatural,

00:12:14.280 --> 00:12:16.540 line:0%
using strange powers to confuse people.

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:18.360 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:12:18.680 --> 00:12:21.210 line:0%
Rumors only spread when the truth is unclear.

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:23.320 line:0%
I believe the most urgent matter right now

00:12:23.320 --> 00:12:24.960 line:0%
is to dispatch capable officials

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:26.520 line:0%
to Gannan Area as soon as possible,

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:27.600 line:0%
assist Mo Qianzhi to

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:28.810 line:0%
uncover the truth,

00:12:28.950 --> 00:12:30.150 line:0%
and quell the rumors.

00:12:31.400 --> 00:12:32.420 line:0%
Wan'er.

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:34.360 line:0%
Who do you think

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:38.140 line:0%
would be the most suitable to send there?

00:12:39.880 --> 00:12:41.490 line:0%
Your Majesty, I believe

00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:43.560 line:0%
you've already made a decision.

00:12:45.100 --> 00:12:46.170 line:0%
Oh, you.

00:13:05.120 --> 00:13:06.140 line:0%
Your Majesty.

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:07.160 line:0%
They've arrived.

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:11.670 line:0%
-I, Shen Du,
-I, Yan Xing,

00:13:11.670 --> 00:13:13.800 line:0%
pay our respects to you, Your Majesty.

00:13:21.090 --> 00:13:22.350 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen.

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:34.300 line:0%
[I, Prefectural Governor of Yingzhou, Mo Qianzhi, hereby report the tragedy of a "half-faced ghost" eating people.]

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:39.220 line:0%
Mr. Shen.

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:41.240 line:0%
Do you see?

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:43.120 line:0%
There are people taking advantage of

00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:44.760 line:0%
the panic in Gannan Area

00:13:45.500 --> 00:13:47.080 line:0%
to incite unrest again.

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:49.720 line:0%
I remember

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:53.560 line:0%
you and Mo Qianzhi, the prefectural governor of Yingzhou,

00:13:54.690 --> 00:13:56.960 line:0%
had some connections in the past.

00:13:57.560 --> 00:13:58.360 line:0%
Therefore,

00:13:58.890 --> 00:14:00.880 line:0%
I'm sending you and your wife

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:03.080 line:0%
to Gannan Area together

00:14:04.020 --> 00:14:08.350 line:0%
to thoroughly investigate the case of the "half-faced ghost" eating people.

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:12.740 line:0%
I accept the imperial order.

00:14:17.220 --> 00:14:18.820 line:0%
Secretary Yan, please stay.

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:33.680 line:0%
Give the brocade jacket to Secretary Yan.

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:36.440 line:0%
Come up.

00:14:40.360 --> 00:14:41.280 line:0%
Her Majesty thinks that

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:42.840 line:0%
since you two got married not long ago

00:14:42.840 --> 00:14:44.680 line:0%
and are about to go to Gannan Area for case investigation,

00:14:44.680 --> 00:14:45.880 line:0%
she specially asked me to prepare some

00:14:45.880 --> 00:14:47.280 line:0%
windproof brocade jackets

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:48.540 line:0%
for you to choose from.

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:00.960 line:0%
This is...

00:15:01.520 --> 00:15:02.360 line:0%
This is a secret edict

00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:03.800 line:0%
from the Grand Empress Dowager.

00:15:03.800 --> 00:15:05.060 line:0%
Open it and take a look.

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:19.170 line:0%
[I order you to conduct a covert investigation, to discern his actions, and confirm if there are any accomplices in communication with him in court.]

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:19.170 line:0%
[Cases of supernatural disturbances have been frequently occurring in Gannan Area. I'm worried that Mo Qianzhi, the prefectural governor of Yingzhou, may have developed ulterior motives.]

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:19.170 line:0%
[Edict to Yan Xing, Document Secretary of the Ministry of Justice]

00:15:21.640 --> 00:15:22.680 line:0%
Secretary Yan.

00:15:23.550 --> 00:15:25.750 line:0%
Remember I once asked you

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:28.500 line:0%
what reward you wanted?

00:15:30.640 --> 00:15:32.200 line:0%
Your Majesty, all I request

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:34.640 line:0%
is that you address me as Miss Yan from now on,

00:15:34.640 --> 00:15:35.920 line:0%
instead of Mrs. Shen.

00:15:36.880 --> 00:15:39.340 line:0%
You don't want to bear the title of Mrs. Shen,

00:15:39.640 --> 00:15:40.520 line:0%
and wish to be

00:15:40.560 --> 00:15:43.360 line:0%
a real female official of the Ministry of Justice.

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:46.900 line:0%
My order today

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:51.080 line:0%
is for you to fulfill the duties of a female official,

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:53.700 line:0%
to serve the Ministry of Justice,

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:55.880 line:0%
and to serve me.

00:15:57.120 --> 00:15:58.080 line:0%
Secretary Yan.

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:00.200 line:0%
Do you understand?

00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:07.020 line:0%
I understand, Your Majesty.

00:16:08.530 --> 00:16:10.430 line:0%
I accept the imperial edict.

00:16:10.510 --> 00:16:13.200 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:20.880 line:0%
Cases of supernatural disturbances

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:23.750 line:0%
have been frequently occurring in Gannan Area.

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:27.200 line:0%
I'm worried that Mo Qianzhi, the prefectural governor of Yingzhou,

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:28.950 line:0%
may have developed ulterior motives.

00:16:28.950 --> 00:16:31.550 line:0%
I order you to conduct a covert investigation,

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:33.000 line:0%
to discern his actions

00:16:33.060 --> 00:16:36.770 line:0%
and confirm if there are any accomplices in communication with him in court.

00:16:36.770 --> 00:16:39.040 line:0%
When the red-feathered gray pigeon arrives,

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:40.480 line:0%
messages can be sent.

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:48.080 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager has issued this secret edict to me.

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:49.320 line:0%
Could it be that the accomplice she suspects

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:50.400 line:0%
is none other than

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:52.360 line:0%
Shen Du?

00:16:54.130 --> 00:16:56.040 line:0%
And she only issued it to me.

00:16:56.560 --> 00:16:59.330 line:0%
Could it be that she has figured out that our marriage is fake?

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:01.330 line:0%
Or is she intentionally testing me?

00:17:05.520 --> 00:17:06.649 line:0%
Why are you smiling?

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:10.040 line:0%
The brocade jacket tribute from Shazhou

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:11.659 line:0%
has always been known for its unparalleled embroidery.

00:17:11.659 --> 00:17:12.860 line:0%
I was smiling because

00:17:12.869 --> 00:17:14.909 line:0%
you stayed behind and spent so long picking out clothes,

00:17:14.909 --> 00:17:16.440 line:0%
yet you ended up choosing this one.

00:17:15.139 --> 00:17:15.879 line:0%
[Report]

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:17.960 line:0%
It's truly a waste of

00:17:17.960 --> 00:17:19.780 line:0%
the Grand Empress Dowager's kindness.

00:17:19.780 --> 00:17:20.680 line:0%
Such embroidery patterns

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:22.940 line:0%
can be seen everywhere in Xiang'an City.

00:17:23.240 --> 00:17:25.520 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager bestowed it upon me to wear.

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:27.110 line:0%
All that matters is I like it.

00:17:27.110 --> 00:17:28.080 line:0%
Actually, I think

00:17:28.080 --> 00:17:29.800 line:0%
this embroidery is exquisite and elegant.

00:17:29.800 --> 00:17:30.960 line:0%
Insisting on piling up patterns

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:32.360 line:0%
is what's truly vulgar.

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:33.460 line:0%
Alright, alright.

00:17:33.520 --> 00:17:35.180 line:0%
Since it was bestowed upon you, Honey,

00:17:35.180 --> 00:17:37.180 line:0%
all that matters is that you like it.

00:17:45.260 --> 00:17:47.590 line:0%
If Mo Qianzhi truly has ulterior motives,

00:17:48.650 --> 00:17:50.100 line:0%
what should he do?

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:58.130 line:0%
[Guangyue Restaurant]

00:18:03.960 --> 00:18:05.440 line:0%
I wondered

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:07.420 line:0%
why this disciple of mine

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:08.600 line:0%
suddenly wanted

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:10.720 line:0%
to treat me to tea.

00:18:11.120 --> 00:18:12.250 line:0%
It turns out

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:13.640 line:0%
you want to inquire about

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:15.960 line:0%
Mo Qianzhi, the prefectural governor of Yingzhou.

00:18:15.960 --> 00:18:17.840 line:0%
You should ask that husband of yours

00:18:17.840 --> 00:18:19.600 line:0%
about this.

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:20.940 line:0%
Coming to ask me

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:23.300 line:0%
is really going out of your way.

00:18:23.400 --> 00:18:24.200 line:0%
Why?

00:18:25.440 --> 00:18:26.920 line:0%
This Mo Qianzhi

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:29.000 line:0%
was originally a favorite student

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:31.200 line:0%
and a close disciple of

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:33.040 line:0%
Shen Du's father, Shen Bingzhu.

00:18:33.760 --> 00:18:35.000 line:0%
No wonder.

00:18:36.120 --> 00:18:37.850 line:0%
So they're old acquaintances.

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:39.920 line:0%
More than just acquaintances.

00:18:39.940 --> 00:18:41.280 line:0%
This Mo Qianzhi

00:18:41.320 --> 00:18:43.460 line:0%
was originally a talent of great potential,

00:18:43.460 --> 00:18:45.080 line:0%
with a promising career in officialdom.

00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:48.180 line:0%
But later, when the Shen family committed that major crime,

00:18:48.180 --> 00:18:51.380 line:0%
he risked his life to plead for his teacher before the emperor,

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:53.640 line:0%
and he strongly advocated for Shen Du not to be executed

00:18:53.640 --> 00:18:55.440 line:0%
and to be sent to the Prisoner's Center instead.

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:58.320 line:0%
As for himself, he ended up being sent to the frontier,

00:18:58.320 --> 00:19:01.280 line:0%
with no hope for promotion since then.

00:19:02.440 --> 00:19:03.840 line:0%
What a pity.

00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:05.240 line:0%
A pity indeed.

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:11.120 line:0%
Since you came to see me today,

00:19:11.440 --> 00:19:13.080 line:0%
I guess Mo Qianzhi

00:19:13.160 --> 00:19:15.420 line:0%
has gotten involved in some case, right?

00:19:18.740 --> 00:19:20.310 line:0%
Don't forget.

00:19:20.440 --> 00:19:23.940 line:0%
Although I, your master, have retired,

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:25.270 line:0%
I still have

00:19:25.320 --> 00:19:28.440 line:0%
that ability to investigate and analyze people.

00:19:33.840 --> 00:19:35.590 line:0%
You're worried that

00:19:35.840 --> 00:19:37.300 line:0%
investigating one person

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:38.320 line:0%
might implicate

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:41.380 line:0%
another person close to you.

00:19:41.670 --> 00:19:43.950 line:0%
Am I right, my disciple?

00:19:46.680 --> 00:19:47.740 line:0%
Master.

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:50.150 line:0%
I still have much to learn.

00:19:51.200 --> 00:19:53.240 line:0%
To uncover the truth,

00:19:53.280 --> 00:19:55.000 line:0%
you inevitably have to go through

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:56.920 line:0%
what you're experiencing now.

00:19:57.240 --> 00:19:59.160 line:0%
No matter how small the detail,

00:19:59.240 --> 00:20:01.160 line:0%
or how close that person is to you,

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:04.160 line:0%
first, don't be afraid to doubt.

00:20:04.200 --> 00:20:06.520 line:0%
You must dare to verify them.

00:20:06.630 --> 00:20:07.800 line:0%
Trust

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:10.240 line:0%
can also be a form of

00:20:10.280 --> 00:20:12.240 line:0%
investigative power.

00:20:13.880 --> 00:20:15.120 line:0%
Alright, alright.

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:16.880 line:0%
You've learned what you wanted to know.

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:19.000 line:0%
Now, how about brewing another pot of good tea for your master?

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:20.280 line:0%
Certainly, Master.

00:20:20.760 --> 00:20:22.460 line:0%
That's more like it.

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:24.880 line:0%
Alright.

00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:30.850 line:0%
Shen Du is going to Gannan Area?

00:20:37.550 --> 00:20:38.700 line:0%
Those goods from Yingzhou...

00:20:38.700 --> 00:20:39.760 line:0%
Rest assured, Your Excellency.

00:20:39.760 --> 00:20:41.890 line:0%
That stuff has long been taken care of.

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:46.630 line:0%
If Shen Du intends to go,

00:20:47.120 --> 00:20:48.830 line:0%
then let him.

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:51.040 line:0%
He'll just be

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:52.720 line:0%
shooting himself in the foot.

00:20:53.800 --> 00:20:54.800 line:0%
Your Excellency.

00:20:54.870 --> 00:20:57.240 line:0%
The letter from Lintai has disappeared.

00:21:00.040 --> 00:21:00.840 line:0%
What?

00:21:00.930 --> 00:21:02.330 line:0%
The letter disappeared?

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:03.870 line:0%
I have already investigated.

00:21:03.870 --> 00:21:05.930 line:0%
That letter has indeed gone missing.

00:21:05.960 --> 00:21:06.760 line:0%
Moreover,

00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:08.560 line:0%
the time of that letter's disappearance

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:10.440 line:0%
coincides with the Hongwen Academy examination

00:21:10.440 --> 00:21:11.280 line:0%
and when Grand Commander Shen

00:21:11.280 --> 00:21:13.340 line:0%
took charge of the capital's guards.

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:16.090 line:0%
Well, well, Shen Du.

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:18.080 line:0%
Don't tell me

00:21:18.790 --> 00:21:19.640 line:0%
you're trying to

00:21:19.640 --> 00:21:21.480 line:0%
reopen the old case

00:21:21.900 --> 00:21:23.480 line:0%
of the Shen family.

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:25.560 line:0%
Hurry up. Come on.

00:21:25.600 --> 00:21:26.520 line:0%
Be quick.

00:21:27.320 --> 00:21:28.240 line:0%
The things you asked for,

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:29.970 line:0%
I've got them all ready for you.

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:31.300 line:0%
It's just there are a few items

00:21:31.300 --> 00:21:33.020 line:0%
that I really couldn't find.

00:21:33.760 --> 00:21:34.600 line:0%
However,

00:21:34.800 --> 00:21:36.360 line:0%
I managed to get them

00:21:36.400 --> 00:21:38.040 line:0%
from my father's pawnshop for you.

00:21:38.040 --> 00:21:39.720 line:0%
Will Uncle Lu agree to that?

00:21:38.870 --> 00:21:42.450 line:0%
[Prudence and Reverence]

00:21:39.760 --> 00:21:40.640 line:0%
Of course.

00:21:40.680 --> 00:21:42.120 line:0%
I'm his precious daughter.

00:21:42.120 --> 00:21:43.440 line:0%
He has to agree.

00:21:44.300 --> 00:21:45.030 line:0%
Oh, right.

00:21:45.080 --> 00:21:46.920 line:0%
Commander Xu said he has a mission to carry out,

00:21:46.920 --> 00:21:48.120 line:0%
so he couldn't come to see you off.

00:21:48.120 --> 00:21:49.200 line:0%
He asked me to remind you

00:21:49.200 --> 00:21:50.000 line:0%
to keep the token he gave you

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:51.240 line:0%
with you.

00:21:51.280 --> 00:21:52.840 line:0%
If you encounter any problems,

00:21:52.840 --> 00:21:53.400 line:0%
you can seek help

00:21:53.400 --> 00:21:55.080 line:0%
from the local constables.

00:21:55.720 --> 00:21:56.120 line:0%
Oh, right.

00:21:56.120 --> 00:21:57.150 line:0%
I almost forgot.

00:21:57.680 --> 00:22:01.120 line:0%
Your mortar and pestle friend Chichi's

00:22:01.120 --> 00:22:03.200 line:0%
handwritten letter has arrived at the Ministry of Justice.

00:22:03.200 --> 00:22:03.920 line:0%
Let me see.

00:22:09.290 --> 00:22:11.080 line:0%
[Xing. Due to some fortuitous circumstances, I'm now on my way to Yingzhou.]

00:22:12.480 --> 00:22:13.480 line:0%
Chichi said

00:22:13.520 --> 00:22:15.320 line:0%
she's already on her way to Yingzhou.

00:22:15.320 --> 00:22:16.320 line:0%
That's perfect. This time,

00:22:16.320 --> 00:22:17.640 line:0%
I can bring all the gifts I prepared

00:22:17.640 --> 00:22:18.730 line:0%
to her.

00:22:21.000 --> 00:22:21.760 line:0%
Master.

00:22:21.760 --> 00:22:22.800 line:0%
Those rare treasures you wanted

00:22:22.800 --> 00:22:23.520 line:0%
have all been delivered.

00:22:23.520 --> 00:22:25.180 line:0%
Aren't I impressive, Master?

00:22:35.720 --> 00:22:36.480 line:0%
Well,

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:39.580 line:0%
[Prudence and Reverence]

00:22:36.480 --> 00:22:37.960 line:0%
now that we've delivered everything, we'll take our leave.

00:22:37.960 --> 00:22:38.760 line:0%
-Have a safe journey.
-Master.

00:22:38.760 --> 00:22:39.160 line:0%
Let's go.

00:22:39.160 --> 00:22:40.760 line:0%
Have a safe journey, Master.

00:22:47.530 --> 00:22:49.240 line:0%
What are these rare treasures

00:22:50.430 --> 00:22:51.430 line:0%
for?

00:22:52.440 --> 00:22:54.560 line:0%
They're gifts from loyal friends.

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:57.550 line:0%
Friends?

00:22:58.070 --> 00:22:59.410 line:0%
Such a grand gesture.

00:23:04.810 --> 00:23:06.940 line:0%
We only have one trailer for this trip,

00:23:07.040 --> 00:23:08.370 line:0%
with limited capacity.

00:23:08.880 --> 00:23:10.410 line:0%
We should all travel light.

00:23:11.960 --> 00:23:13.220 line:0%
Anything unnecessary

00:23:17.070 --> 00:23:18.330 line:0%
should be left behind.

00:23:18.550 --> 00:23:19.640 line:0%
Grand Commander, you don't need to worry about

00:23:19.640 --> 00:23:20.570 line:0%
the trailer issue.

00:23:20.570 --> 00:23:22.060 line:0%
I just arranged for two more.

00:23:22.060 --> 00:23:23.680 line:0%
No matter how much luggage Madam has,

00:23:23.680 --> 00:23:25.140 line:0%
there'll be enough space.

00:23:29.530 --> 00:23:31.150 line:0%
This is an official trip,

00:23:32.200 --> 00:23:33.690 line:0%
not a social visit.

00:23:34.340 --> 00:23:36.360 line:0%
We'll only bring the essentials.

00:23:39.420 --> 00:23:41.190 line:0%
These are all essentials.

00:23:42.400 --> 00:23:43.360 line:0%
Xing!

00:23:44.280 --> 00:23:45.300 line:0%
Grand Commander!

00:23:45.670 --> 00:23:47.550 line:0%
[Prudence and Reverence]

00:23:46.720 --> 00:23:47.520 line:0%
Xing.

00:23:47.680 --> 00:23:49.480 line:0%
I'm here to deliver some things.

00:23:49.930 --> 00:23:52.200 line:0%
Here's the medicine for bruises and injuries.

00:23:52.200 --> 00:23:53.240 line:0%
Cured meat and salted fish.

00:23:53.240 --> 00:23:54.440 line:0%
And this is from Caiwei and your father...

00:23:54.440 --> 00:23:55.480 line:0%
Mother. Mother.

00:23:55.960 --> 00:23:58.000 line:0%
We only have one trailer this time,

00:23:58.000 --> 00:23:58.920 line:0%
with limited load capacity.

00:23:58.920 --> 00:24:00.780 line:0%
We can only bring the essentials.

00:24:01.880 --> 00:24:03.680 line:0%
You don't have enough trailers?

00:24:04.400 --> 00:24:05.560 line:0%
Your father has one.

00:24:05.560 --> 00:24:07.160 line:0%
I can bring it over right now.

00:24:07.640 --> 00:24:08.640 line:0%
No need to bother.

00:24:13.320 --> 00:24:14.120 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:24:14.920 --> 00:24:15.720 line:0%
Yes.

00:24:15.740 --> 00:24:18.200 line:0%
Where's that trailer you just arranged for?

00:24:20.720 --> 00:24:21.520 line:0%
I...

00:24:21.580 --> 00:24:22.530 line:0%
It should be arriving soon.

00:24:22.530 --> 00:24:23.330 line:0%
I'll go check.

00:24:23.430 --> 00:24:26.510 line:0%
[Prudence and Reverence]

00:24:23.960 --> 00:24:24.760 line:0%
Let's go.

00:24:25.640 --> 00:24:27.160 line:0%
Didn't he just say no additional trailers are allowed?

00:24:27.160 --> 00:24:28.320 line:0%
When the Grand Commander says yes, it means no.

00:24:28.320 --> 00:24:29.240 line:0%
When he says no, it means yes.

00:24:29.240 --> 00:24:29.920 line:0%
I've told you before,

00:24:29.920 --> 00:24:30.920 line:0%
this job isn't easy.

00:24:30.920 --> 00:24:31.640 line:0%
Hurry up.

00:24:33.080 --> 00:24:33.880 line:0%
Xing.

00:24:34.120 --> 00:24:35.120 line:0%
It's freezing cold at the frontier, and the condition is harsh.

00:24:35.120 --> 00:24:35.960 line:0%
And it's your first time

00:24:35.960 --> 00:24:37.200 line:0%
traveling so far from home.

00:24:37.200 --> 00:24:38.720 line:0%
Be careful in everything you do.

00:24:38.720 --> 00:24:40.400 line:0%
If you really encounter difficulties,

00:24:40.400 --> 00:24:41.280 line:0%
don't try to be a hero.

00:24:41.280 --> 00:24:43.560 line:0%
Staying alive is the most important thing.

00:24:43.560 --> 00:24:44.360 line:0%
Mother.

00:24:44.720 --> 00:24:45.800 line:0%
I'm going there to investigate a case,

00:24:45.800 --> 00:24:47.240 line:0%
not to fight a war.

00:24:47.680 --> 00:24:48.480 line:0%
Remember

00:24:48.640 --> 00:24:49.480 line:0%
to take good care of

00:24:49.480 --> 00:24:50.560 line:0%
yourself.

00:24:51.320 --> 00:24:52.470 line:0%
Also,

00:24:52.600 --> 00:24:53.690 line:0%
tell Father

00:24:53.800 --> 00:24:54.980 line:0%
to avoid court disputes

00:24:54.980 --> 00:24:56.000 line:0%
if possible.

00:24:56.000 --> 00:24:56.720 line:0%
Everything

00:24:56.720 --> 00:24:58.500 line:0%
can wait until we return.

00:25:00.200 --> 00:25:01.240 line:0%
If there's any trouble,

00:25:01.240 --> 00:25:02.280 line:0%
remember to write to us.

00:25:02.280 --> 00:25:03.380 line:0%
I understand.

00:25:03.840 --> 00:25:04.600 line:0%
Don't worry about

00:25:04.600 --> 00:25:05.880 line:0%
things at home.

00:25:05.880 --> 00:25:07.000 line:0%
I'm more worried about you two.

00:25:07.000 --> 00:25:08.640 line:0%
If you encounter any trouble out there,

00:25:08.640 --> 00:25:09.970 line:0%
we won't be able to help.

00:25:10.080 --> 00:25:12.890 line:0%
You must look out for each other.

00:25:14.540 --> 00:25:15.930 line:0%
Mother-in-law, don't worry.

00:25:15.930 --> 00:25:17.800 line:0%
I will take good care of her.

00:25:21.210 --> 00:25:22.250 line:0%
That's good then.

00:25:27.250 --> 00:25:35.700 line:0%
[Xiang'an City]

00:26:58.040 --> 00:26:58.840 line:0%
You're awake.

00:27:01.360 --> 00:27:02.000 line:0%
I thought

00:27:02.000 --> 00:27:04.000 line:0%
given how deeply you were sleeping,

00:27:04.000 --> 00:27:06.200 line:0%
you might sleep all the way to Yingzhou.

00:27:06.480 --> 00:27:07.280 line:0%
I...

00:27:08.400 --> 00:27:10.800 line:0%
It was because I didn't sleep well last night.

00:27:10.800 --> 00:27:12.680 line:0%
I'm not usually like this.

00:27:22.310 --> 00:27:23.500 line:0%
The scenery outside the city

00:27:23.500 --> 00:27:25.500 line:0%
is indeed different from Xiang'an.

00:27:27.010 --> 00:27:28.290 line:0%
Madam, what's wrong?

00:27:28.920 --> 00:27:29.760 line:0%
It's nothing.

00:27:29.760 --> 00:27:31.960 line:0%
I just want to take a look at the scenery.

00:27:40.540 --> 00:27:42.330 line:0%
May I read it?

00:28:15.200 --> 00:28:16.260 line:0%
Stop the carriage.

00:28:26.480 --> 00:28:27.880 line:0%
You few, keep watch around the area.

00:28:27.880 --> 00:28:28.480 line:0%
All of you, turn your backs.

00:28:28.480 --> 00:28:29.120 line:0%
Yes.

00:28:54.560 --> 00:28:55.620 line:0%
If you feel unwell,

00:28:56.160 --> 00:28:57.360 line:0%
tell me immediately.

00:29:02.450 --> 00:29:03.520 line:0%
Thank you.

00:29:05.200 --> 00:29:07.860 line:0%
I'm just worried you might vomit in the carriage

00:29:07.990 --> 00:29:09.350 line:0%
and dirty my carriage.

00:29:12.920 --> 00:29:14.590 line:0%
I'll be careful.

00:29:15.240 --> 00:29:17.270 line:0%
But you Imperial Security Bureau's riding skills

00:29:17.270 --> 00:29:18.840 line:0%
are really terrible.

00:29:19.080 --> 00:29:21.080 line:0%
Swerving left and right all the way.

00:29:24.160 --> 00:29:25.690 line:0%
Ever since we left the city,

00:29:26.120 --> 00:29:28.400 line:0%
we've been closely watched by various groups of people.

00:29:28.400 --> 00:29:29.550 line:0%
If we don't change lanes abruptly,

00:29:29.550 --> 00:29:31.350 line:0%
how can we shake off those spies?

00:29:40.480 --> 00:29:41.410 line:0%
There are spies.

00:29:41.960 --> 00:29:44.000 line:0%
In the woods to the north and the west.

00:29:44.000 --> 00:29:45.040 line:0%
Change lanes quickly.

00:29:45.040 --> 00:29:45.840 line:0%
Yes.

00:29:46.850 --> 00:29:48.850 line:0%
I didn't expect during our journey,

00:29:48.930 --> 00:29:51.070 line:0%
there would be so many people watching us.

00:29:51.070 --> 00:29:52.870 line:0%
I'm afraid this trip to Yingzhou

00:29:53.360 --> 00:29:54.720 line:0%
isn't that simple.

00:30:37.640 --> 00:30:38.760 line:0%
Imperial Guards and the carriage convoy,

00:30:38.760 --> 00:30:40.360 line:0%
proceed along the original route.

00:30:40.360 --> 00:30:42.150 line:0%
After ensuring all tails are shaken off,

00:30:42.150 --> 00:30:44.210 line:0%
rendezvous with us in Shanyang City.

00:30:54.580 --> 00:30:56.430 line:0%
[Shanyang City Inn]

00:31:29.280 --> 00:31:30.160 line:0%
Remember what I said,

00:31:30.160 --> 00:31:31.040 line:0%
no one is to disturb

00:31:31.040 --> 00:31:31.680 line:0%
their rest.

00:31:31.680 --> 00:31:32.480 line:0%
No problem.

00:31:36.200 --> 00:31:37.600 line:0%
Grand Commander, Madam.

00:31:37.920 --> 00:31:39.120 line:0%
Your rooms are ready.

00:31:39.120 --> 00:31:40.160 line:0%
After you finish your meal,

00:31:40.160 --> 00:31:42.160 line:0%
you may return to your rooms to rest.

00:31:43.530 --> 00:31:44.560 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:31:47.240 --> 00:31:49.370 line:0%
The luggage still hasn't arrived yet?

00:31:50.480 --> 00:31:51.280 line:0%
Madam.

00:31:52.030 --> 00:31:53.920 line:0%
The luggage trailer will arrive a bit later,

00:31:53.920 --> 00:31:55.240 line:0%
about an hour.

00:32:15.490 --> 00:32:16.450 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:32:16.450 --> 00:32:17.620 line:0%
Madam's luggage trailer

00:32:17.620 --> 00:32:18.560 line:0%
is full of the medicated diet ingredients

00:32:18.560 --> 00:32:19.760 line:0%
she prepared for you.

00:32:21.960 --> 00:32:22.900 line:0%
Are you saying

00:32:23.380 --> 00:32:25.100 line:0%
those big cases she brought

00:32:25.720 --> 00:32:26.930 line:0%
are filled with medicated diet?

00:32:26.930 --> 00:32:27.730 line:0%
Yes.

00:32:28.040 --> 00:32:29.040 line:0%
They are all ingredients of medicated diet

00:32:29.040 --> 00:32:30.600 line:0%
that Madam collected from various places.

00:32:30.600 --> 00:32:32.120 line:0%
Madam deliberately didn't tell you,

00:32:32.120 --> 00:32:34.000 line:0%
probably because she knew you don't like medicated diet

00:32:34.000 --> 00:32:35.730 line:0%
and wouldn't agree to bring it.

00:33:21.040 --> 00:33:21.840 line:0%
Who's there?

00:33:22.560 --> 00:33:23.360 line:0%
Come here.

00:33:27.680 --> 00:33:28.480 line:0%
Master!

00:33:28.600 --> 00:33:29.740 line:0%
Master, save me!

00:33:29.840 --> 00:33:31.440 line:0%
Help! Master!

00:33:34.020 --> 00:33:35.260 line:0%
Qi Yeyun?

00:33:37.680 --> 00:33:39.120 line:0%
Thank goodness you're here, Master.

00:33:39.120 --> 00:33:39.640 line:0%
Otherwise, I would

00:33:39.640 --> 00:33:41.170 line:0%
have been strangled by him.

00:33:42.960 --> 00:33:43.760 line:0%
Let me see.

00:33:46.230 --> 00:33:47.180 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:33:47.360 --> 00:33:48.600 line:0%
You even laid hands on a kid.

00:33:48.600 --> 00:33:49.760 line:0%
How cruel.

00:33:51.880 --> 00:33:53.360 line:0%
What kind of kid would sneak around

00:33:53.360 --> 00:33:54.360 line:0%
outside someone else's guest room

00:33:54.360 --> 00:33:55.400 line:0%
in the middle of the night?

00:33:55.400 --> 00:33:57.400 line:0%
Must be up to no good.

00:34:01.290 --> 00:34:03.120 line:0%
Weren't you also wandering

00:34:03.120 --> 00:34:05.000 line:0%
outside someone else's guest room late at night?

00:34:05.000 --> 00:34:07.200 line:0%
Your footsteps were so loud that I couldn't even sleep.

00:34:07.200 --> 00:34:08.729 line:0%
You must be up to no good too.

00:34:11.800 --> 00:34:13.240 line:0%
I ate too much tonight

00:34:13.400 --> 00:34:14.930 line:0%
and was just walking it off.

00:34:15.160 --> 00:34:15.950 line:0%
Jing Lin!

00:34:19.920 --> 00:34:21.729 line:0%
Is this how you shook off the spies?

00:34:21.729 --> 00:34:23.459 line:0%
Even a kid managed to follow us.

00:34:23.459 --> 00:34:25.280 line:0%
It's my fault for failing in my duty.

00:34:25.280 --> 00:34:27.010 line:0%
I didn't follow you all the way.

00:34:27.360 --> 00:34:28.160 line:0%
I just secretly followed you

00:34:28.160 --> 00:34:29.510 line:0%
to the outskirts of town.

00:34:29.510 --> 00:34:30.840 line:0%
I snuck inside

00:34:31.080 --> 00:34:32.740 line:0%
while the carriage was empty.

00:34:32.800 --> 00:34:33.950 line:0%
I hid under the carriage seat

00:34:33.950 --> 00:34:34.840 line:0%
in the carved cabinet.

00:34:34.840 --> 00:34:37.170 line:0%
That's how I followed you all the way here.

00:34:38.950 --> 00:34:39.760 line:0%
Master.

00:34:39.880 --> 00:34:40.640 line:0%
Am I qualified

00:34:40.640 --> 00:34:41.720 line:0%
to be your disciple now?

00:34:41.720 --> 00:34:43.030 line:0%
I want to learn skills from you

00:34:43.030 --> 00:34:43.800 line:0%
and become a master detective

00:34:43.800 --> 00:34:44.640 line:0%
like you.

00:34:45.280 --> 00:34:46.080 line:0%
Master.

00:34:46.120 --> 00:34:47.280 line:0%
Please take me as your disciple.

00:34:47.280 --> 00:34:48.439 line:0%
Hold on, hold on.

00:34:48.510 --> 00:34:49.920 line:0%
Don't call me Master.

00:34:50.170 --> 00:34:51.439 line:0%
Just call me Sister.

00:34:51.499 --> 00:34:54.360 line:0%
Learning skills requires careful consideration.

00:34:54.560 --> 00:34:56.160 line:0%
Since you've followed us all the way here,

00:34:56.160 --> 00:34:57.040 line:0%
you might as well stay.

00:34:57.040 --> 00:34:57.680 line:0%
When the time comes,

00:34:57.680 --> 00:34:58.960 line:0%
you can return to Xiang'an with us.

00:34:58.960 --> 00:35:00.020 line:0%
Thank you, Sister.

00:35:00.280 --> 00:35:01.040 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:35:01.040 --> 00:35:02.360 line:0%
Are there have any spare rooms?

00:35:02.360 --> 00:35:02.760 line:0%
Yes.

00:35:02.760 --> 00:35:03.560 line:0%
I'll arrange it right away.

00:35:03.560 --> 00:35:04.400 line:0%
Guard Jing.

00:35:05.480 --> 00:35:07.740 line:0%
Who gave you permission to arrange that?

00:35:07.880 --> 00:35:08.680 line:0%
Right.

00:35:10.310 --> 00:35:11.800 line:0%
You and I

00:35:11.840 --> 00:35:12.560 line:0%
are both

00:35:12.560 --> 00:35:14.720 line:0%
commissioned by the Grand Empress Dowager to investigate the case.

00:35:14.720 --> 00:35:15.520 line:0%
How come

00:35:15.720 --> 00:35:16.480 line:0%
I don't even have the right

00:35:16.480 --> 00:35:17.360 line:0%
to arrange for

00:35:17.360 --> 00:35:18.160 line:0%
an attendant?

00:35:18.840 --> 00:35:19.760 line:0%
Brother-in-law.

00:35:19.760 --> 00:35:21.360 line:0%
I don't have to stay in a room.

00:35:21.400 --> 00:35:22.840 line:0%
As long as you're willing to take me in,

00:35:22.840 --> 00:35:25.170 line:0%
I can sleep in the woodshed or on the floor.

00:35:27.680 --> 00:35:28.630 line:0%
You...

00:35:34.870 --> 00:35:36.270 line:0%
What did you just call me?

00:35:36.970 --> 00:35:38.010 line:0%
Brother-in-law.

00:35:38.640 --> 00:35:39.710 line:0%
Sister asked me

00:35:39.760 --> 00:35:40.960 line:0%
not to call her Master

00:35:41.000 --> 00:35:42.600 line:0%
and call her Sister instead.

00:35:42.760 --> 00:35:44.400 line:0%
Since I call her Sister,

00:35:44.430 --> 00:35:46.560 line:0%
shouldn't I call you Brother-in-law?

00:35:53.020 --> 00:35:54.870 line:0%
Isn't that right?

00:35:57.310 --> 00:35:58.160 line:0%
If you don't like

00:35:58.160 --> 00:35:59.660 line:0%
the title of Brother-in-law,

00:35:59.660 --> 00:36:01.730 line:0%
how about I call you Grand Commander Shen?

00:36:01.730 --> 00:36:02.920 line:0%
Or Hero Shen?

00:36:06.900 --> 00:36:09.060 line:0%
I like none of them.

00:36:15.730 --> 00:36:17.220 line:0%
This is an official trip.

00:36:17.360 --> 00:36:19.220 line:0%
We don't keep idle people around.

00:36:19.320 --> 00:36:20.580 line:0%
With your small frame,

00:36:20.580 --> 00:36:22.110 line:0%
you can't do any heavy work.

00:36:23.880 --> 00:36:24.680 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:36:25.280 --> 00:36:26.080 line:0%
Yes.

00:36:26.360 --> 00:36:27.640 line:0%
I'll remove the unnecessary personnel

00:36:27.640 --> 00:36:28.860 line:0%
from the inn right away.

00:36:28.860 --> 00:36:31.220 line:0%
Who told you to kick him out?

00:36:33.350 --> 00:36:34.510 line:0%
From now on,

00:36:35.800 --> 00:36:36.850 line:0%
he'll be staying with you.

00:36:36.850 --> 00:36:39.200 line:0%
-Iâ€¦
-Take this as an opportunity to train him,

00:36:39.200 --> 00:36:41.000 line:0%
so he's not just eating for free.

00:36:43.360 --> 00:36:44.000 line:0%
Huh?

00:36:44.000 --> 00:36:45.200 line:0%
What are you "huh"-ing about?

00:36:45.200 --> 00:36:46.920 line:0%
Is it so difficult for you to take care of a kid?

00:36:46.920 --> 00:36:48.000 line:0%
I obey your orders.

00:36:48.920 --> 00:36:49.720 line:0%
Kid,

00:36:49.720 --> 00:36:50.520 line:0%
come with me.

00:36:53.080 --> 00:36:54.080 line:0%
Brother-in-law.

00:36:54.110 --> 00:36:55.240 line:0%
Please don't, Brother-in-law!

00:36:55.240 --> 00:36:56.440 line:0%
I don't want to train!

00:37:07.010 --> 00:37:08.640 line:0%
[Yingzhou]

00:37:19.700 --> 00:37:25.260 line:0%
[Virtue Shines Through Abundance]

00:37:24.460 --> 00:37:25.660 line:0%
It's broad daylight.

00:37:25.680 --> 00:37:26.360 line:0%
Why is the main hall of the government office

00:37:26.360 --> 00:37:27.600 line:0%
completely empty?

00:37:27.960 --> 00:37:29.400 line:0%
The Grand Commander has arrived.

00:37:29.400 --> 00:37:30.120 line:0%
Is there no one on duty

00:37:30.120 --> 00:37:32.250 line:0%
at the government office of Yingzhou?

00:37:33.180 --> 00:37:36.970 line:0%
[Virtue Shines Through Abundance]

00:37:36.240 --> 00:37:37.360 line:0%
I am Bi Qiu, Discipline Inspector of Yingzhou.

00:37:37.360 --> 00:37:38.960 line:0%
Greetings, Grand Commander Shen and Secretary Yan.

00:37:38.960 --> 00:37:40.080 line:0%
This humble official was unaware of your arrival

00:37:39.540 --> 00:37:40.480 line:0%
[Discipline Inspector, Bi Qiu]

00:37:40.080 --> 00:37:40.920 line:0%
and failed to welcome you from afar.

00:37:40.920 --> 00:37:41.720 line:0%
It's alright.

00:37:42.280 --> 00:37:43.480 line:0%
Where is Governor Mo?

00:37:43.640 --> 00:37:44.440 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:37:44.020 --> 00:37:46.450 line:0%
[Virtue Shines Through Abundance] [Uphold Virtue Selflessly]

00:37:44.440 --> 00:37:45.840 line:0%
Governor Mo has gone out on official business.

00:37:45.840 --> 00:37:46.720 line:0%
I've sent people to call for him.

00:37:46.720 --> 00:37:48.050 line:0%
He will be here shortly.

00:37:49.190 --> 00:37:50.590 line:0%
Governor Mo has arrived.

00:37:59.260 --> 00:38:01.200 line:0%
[Prefectural Governor of Yingzhou, Mo Qianzhi]

00:38:01.160 --> 00:38:02.920 line:0%
This humble official, Mo Qianzhi,

00:38:02.920 --> 00:38:05.320 line:0%
apologizes for not greeting you from afar.

00:38:05.370 --> 00:38:06.970 line:0%
Please forgive any offense.

00:38:10.800 --> 00:38:11.600 line:0%
Governor Mo.

00:38:12.020 --> 00:38:15.150 line:0%
[Virtue Shines Through Abundance][Uphold Virtue Selflessly]

00:38:12.800 --> 00:38:14.520 line:0%
Were you just working on a case

00:38:14.600 --> 00:38:16.200 line:0%
and in contact with a corpse?

00:38:18.240 --> 00:38:19.160 line:0%
How do you know?

00:38:20.280 --> 00:38:21.940 line:0%
Those who frequently come into contact with corpses

00:38:21.940 --> 00:38:24.070 line:0%
inevitably carry some corpse energy.

00:38:25.480 --> 00:38:26.200 line:0%
I presume

00:38:26.200 --> 00:38:26.680 line:0%
this must be

00:38:26.680 --> 00:38:28.160 line:0%
the renowned extraordinary woman of Xiang'an,

00:38:28.160 --> 00:38:29.420 line:0%
Secretary Yan, right?

00:38:35.040 --> 00:38:36.800 line:0%
Secretary Yan, your perceptiveness is remarkable.

00:38:36.800 --> 00:38:38.600 line:0%
I deeply admire you.

00:38:39.320 --> 00:38:41.840 line:0%
The distance from Xiang'an to Yingzhou is quite far.

00:38:41.840 --> 00:38:43.500 line:0%
Secretary Yan, being a woman,

00:38:43.760 --> 00:38:44.920 line:0%
you must have endured

00:38:44.920 --> 00:38:46.240 line:0%
many hardships on the journey.

00:38:46.240 --> 00:38:48.000 line:0%
Thank you for your concern, Governor Mo.

00:38:48.000 --> 00:38:49.040 line:0%
The journey was smooth,

00:38:49.040 --> 00:38:50.700 line:0%
not particularly difficult.

00:38:51.520 --> 00:38:52.320 line:0%
Senior.

00:38:52.680 --> 00:38:54.080 line:0%
How have you been lately?

00:38:54.670 --> 00:38:55.930 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen.

00:38:56.150 --> 00:38:57.390 line:0%
You flatter me.

00:39:16.120 --> 00:39:17.360 line:0%
I have been negligent in my duties.

00:39:17.360 --> 00:39:19.560 line:0%
Recently, cases have been piling up,

00:39:19.760 --> 00:39:20.720 line:0%
and I haven't had the chance

00:39:20.720 --> 00:39:22.440 line:0%
to prepare a welcoming banquet for you.

00:39:22.440 --> 00:39:23.880 line:0%
It's all for the sake of the people.

00:39:23.880 --> 00:39:25.720 line:0%
How about we start investigating the case today,

00:39:25.720 --> 00:39:26.760 line:0%
solve it as soon as possible,

00:39:26.760 --> 00:39:28.240 line:0%
so the people can have peace of mind sooner?

00:39:28.240 --> 00:39:29.520 line:0%
What do you all think?

00:39:29.720 --> 00:39:31.120 line:0%
How can this be acceptable?

00:39:31.120 --> 00:39:32.760 line:0%
The Grand Commander has come from so far away.

00:39:32.760 --> 00:39:34.040 line:0%
Even if there's no welcoming banquet,

00:39:34.040 --> 00:39:35.440 line:0%
you should at least prepare some tea

00:39:35.440 --> 00:39:36.680 line:0%
to properly welcome him.

00:39:36.680 --> 00:39:38.080 line:0%
You have nothing prepared now.

00:39:38.080 --> 00:39:38.800 line:0%
Isn't this

00:39:38.800 --> 00:39:41.000 line:0%
disrespectful to the Grand Commander?

00:39:42.240 --> 00:39:43.040 line:0%
It's alright.

00:39:45.240 --> 00:39:47.080 line:0%
We came here to investigate the case,

00:39:47.080 --> 00:39:48.340 line:0%
not for a leisure trip.

00:39:48.440 --> 00:39:49.480 line:0%
The sooner we conclude the case,

00:39:49.480 --> 00:39:50.280 line:0%
the sooner we can

00:39:50.280 --> 00:39:51.940 line:0%
return to Xiang'an to report.

00:39:52.080 --> 00:39:52.880 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:39:53.920 --> 00:39:55.850 line:0%
Take Yun to have a quick meal first.

00:39:56.120 --> 00:39:58.850 line:0%
Secretary Yan and I will go investigate the case.

00:39:59.120 --> 00:39:59.920 line:0%
Yes.

00:40:00.920 --> 00:40:01.720 line:0%
Guard Jing,

00:40:01.720 --> 00:40:02.720 line:0%
please follow me.

00:40:13.800 --> 00:40:16.530 line:0%
[Mortuary]

00:40:16.360 --> 00:40:17.320 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:40:17.320 --> 00:40:18.650 line:0%
Here are the case files.

00:40:22.320 --> 00:40:23.840 line:0%
There's a headless corpse down there.

00:40:23.840 --> 00:40:25.320 line:0%
Be careful not to get scared.

00:40:25.320 --> 00:40:26.480 line:0%
She's very brave.

00:40:28.970 --> 00:40:30.770 line:0%
Don't underestimate my wife.

00:40:37.770 --> 00:40:39.330 line:0%
The deceased was named Li Kaixiang.

00:40:39.330 --> 00:40:41.930 line:0%
The suspect is his younger brother, Li Kairui.

00:40:42.240 --> 00:40:44.040 line:0%
The two had an argument while drinking.

00:40:44.040 --> 00:40:45.040 line:0%
After the younger brother got drunk,

00:40:45.040 --> 00:40:46.080 line:0%
he passed out.

00:40:46.080 --> 00:40:47.080 line:0%
When he woke up,

00:40:47.160 --> 00:40:47.960 line:0%
he found that his elder brother's head

00:40:47.960 --> 00:40:48.920 line:0%
was already missing.

00:40:48.920 --> 00:40:50.320 line:0%
It hasn't yet been found.

00:40:52.880 --> 00:40:54.280 line:0%
Have you found anything?

00:40:55.120 --> 00:40:55.840 line:0%
Based on the deceased's

00:40:55.840 --> 00:40:57.660 line:0%
blood coagulation state,

00:40:58.250 --> 00:41:00.320 line:0%
when the victim's head was cut off,

00:41:01.180 --> 00:41:02.640 line:0%
he was likely still alive.

00:41:05.530 --> 00:41:07.130 line:0%
Beheaded while still alive?

00:41:08.400 --> 00:41:09.360 line:0%
At present,

00:41:09.360 --> 00:41:10.840 line:0%
there are only two possibilities.

00:41:10.840 --> 00:41:11.910 line:0%
One is that

00:41:12.240 --> 00:41:13.440 line:0%
before the victim died,

00:41:13.440 --> 00:41:14.900 line:0%
he was in a comatose state.

00:41:15.100 --> 00:41:16.630 line:0%
The killer made a fatal cut.

00:41:16.960 --> 00:41:18.000 line:0%
The other is that

00:41:18.270 --> 00:41:20.480 line:0%
the killer was a top expert.

00:41:20.880 --> 00:41:21.680 line:0%
While the victim's abilities

00:41:21.680 --> 00:41:23.240 line:0%
were inferior to the killer's,

00:41:23.240 --> 00:41:24.880 line:0%
the victim's head was cut off.

00:41:24.880 --> 00:41:26.160 line:0%
But I just checked,

00:41:26.550 --> 00:41:27.440 line:0%
and there are no bruises

00:41:27.440 --> 00:41:28.640 line:0%
on the victim's skin.

00:41:28.770 --> 00:41:30.320 line:0%
The coroner's autopsy

00:41:30.320 --> 00:41:31.760 line:0%
also showed no internal injuries.

00:41:31.760 --> 00:41:32.240 line:0%
Basically,

00:41:32.240 --> 00:41:34.440 line:0%
this rules out the second possibility.

00:41:36.200 --> 00:41:37.890 line:0%
What a brilliant analysis.

00:41:38.480 --> 00:41:39.960 line:0%
Great minds think alike.

00:41:40.120 --> 00:41:41.460 line:0%
The top female detective of the Ministry of Justice

00:41:41.460 --> 00:41:43.320 line:0%
truly lives up to her reputation.

00:41:44.530 --> 00:41:45.510 line:0%
Pan?

00:41:46.360 --> 00:41:47.820 line:0%
Why are you here?

00:41:49.180 --> 00:41:50.130 line:0%
Secretary Yan.

00:41:50.150 --> 00:41:50.950 line:0%
Long time no see.